    "category": "dialogue",
    "speaker_code": "MON4",
    "scene_code": "SAVA_SQ_GAMEPLAY",
    "arabic_current": "<ts=&quot;0;1.46&quot;>مهلا لحظة،<ts=&quot;1.95;4.05&quot;>أعتقد أن لديك ما يكفي<br>!بالفعل",
